__Description__:

This is an implementation of :

1) Incremental Kernel Density Estimation (KDE), and
2) Hierarchical Shrinkage (HS)

in the context of streaming environments


__Directories__:

Our Incremental KDE implementation is located in directory Code, and
our HS implementation is in files:
src/trees/hoeffding_tree_regressor.py and src/trees/hoeffding_tree.py, which aside
from the HS implementation are from the scikit-multiflow library (http://jmlr.org/papers/v19/18-251.html)

The rest of the files that are inside the src directory are from the scikit-multiflow library and are
necessary for our code to run, for technical purposes.


__Experiments__:
Inside the directory Code, there's the experiments.ipynb file, where by changing the paths to yours
you can run our experiments and retrieve the results as we describe in our paper.

//Note : please create all necessary paths for locating the data used and saving
the results of the experiments, which are txt files containing the predictions of the models.//
